---
source: crates/connector-vmm/src/image.rs
expression: table
---
## plain files
"acmesvc:acmegrp" -> 1000:1002
"acmesvc" -> 1000:1001
"1000" -> 1000:1001
"nobody" -> refused: user "nobody" is not in the image's /etc/passwd

## absolute links
"acmesvc:acmegrp" -> 1000:1002
"acmesvc" -> 1000:1001

## relative links climbing above the root
"acmesvc:acmegrp" -> 1000:1002

## /etc an absolute link
"acmesvc:acmegrp" -> 1000:1002

## /etc a relative link climbing above the root
"acmesvc:acmegrp" -> 1000:1002

## links dangling in the image, whose targets exist on the host
"acmesvc" -> refused: user "acmesvc" is not in the image's /etc/passwd
"1000:acmegrp" -> refused: group "acmegrp" is not in the image's /etc/group
"1000:1002" -> 1000:1002

## no account files, as in a scratch image
"" -> 0:0
"1000" -> 1000:0
"1000:1002" -> 1000:1002
"acmesvc" -> refused: user "acmesvc" is not in the image's /etc/passwd

## a link loop
"1000" -> refused: opening the image's /etc/passwd with openat2: Too many levels of symbolic links (os error 40)
